   "image": {
    "local": "images/2026-11-28/107823273.jpg",
    "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c108e13c291741829196e00b898c00c0_2160w_3840h.jpg"
   },
   "category": "家常菜",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "两块生姜、一头大蒜、半个洋葱打成料渣，倒进盆里。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/893059c097144fea9425c47c407e59e9_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "一勺盐，一勺糖。半包盐焗鸡粉，1000毫升清水。搅拌均匀。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/a2b6efba12804070a7d9405f4c3e5601_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "10个鸡翅，泡在水里，放冰箱冷藏一晚（8小时）",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e5bbed36a1a840dda4868d480d87f9b8_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "调脆皮浆：所有的材料都在屏幕上，再准备135克蛋清，15克麦芽糖，用手的温度把麦芽糖融化，一丢丢的老抽，搅拌均匀。参考脆皮浆1/4：https://www.xiachufang.com/recipe/107822710/脆皮水3次，风干1次，脆皮浆1次，风干1次，反复1次；",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/8801077a41cc4c91acba91bedf5cb343_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "因为蛋清比较粘稠，尽量用绞肉机或者榨汁机，或者漏网等辅助工具混合面糊，搅20秒左右，",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/52955e6401824702bbfd436eb94cb4ca_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "成品是这种比较稀的面浆，冷藏2~3个小时。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9bfa20eb01ba4049a46988ebb5a74135_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "冷藏之后蛋清和粉类会分层，每次使用前先充分搅拌均匀，把表面的泡沫撇掉。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/5565b8697a3743029c88809a2439e2f3_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "腌好的鸡翅冲洗干净，用开水烫一下表皮，迅速过冷水，让表皮收紧，擦干水分放入空气炸锅。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-8.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/03b346385b1742c0af517bf504df80f8_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "50度烘烤20分钟，烘干表面的水分。以50度以下的低温去烤，表皮一定要干透。或者飓风烤：80度30分钟。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-9.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9263c19e42f24a4586666d61015bcbf4_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "刷浆之前一定要充分搅拌均匀。正反面都涂一层脆皮浆。放入空气炸锅50度10分钟。或者3D热风80度20分钟。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-10.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/23cea9f8b43342e6a3f8f10a7d0a2aca_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "刷第二遍，空气炸锅50度10分钟或者3D热风80度20分钟。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-11.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/4b98c7b3597a4891a40b3ee8a020e356_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "刷第三遍，这个脆皮浆刚好刷完，空气炸锅，50度30分钟，烘的越干，炸出来就越脆。最终的状态表面形成一层干粉，硬硬的薄壳或者3D热风80度20分钟，飓风80度20分钟。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-12.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/b697b8e865924ab09d2610ea03338cb7_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "冷油放入鸡翅，中小火慢炸或最小火慢炸。8分钟左右是不变色，",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-13.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/6318f847bb9649b09586c4a16d613e4f_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "10分钟左右变成焦黄色",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-14.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/d03a097eddbc48699f85cc928ef50583_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "12分钟左右变成橙红色，捞出来控油",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-15.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1caf83298c6144eab3643c3f3325ec68_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "即便是没有脆皮水和红醋，依然能做到玻璃脆壳，里面的肉又嫩还能爆汁。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-16.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/0daa37bd663e4ceaa98fd5a33b505308_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "空气炸锅版本：表面均匀喷一层油，100度先烤10分钟。再150度10分钟。或者3D热风100度12分钟+空气炸锅150度10分钟",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-17.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/10d60a4a08bc467f97c49ed728aede57_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "200度烘烤5分钟，快速上色。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-18.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/d69be260bd01420b9d51225f2df9f88a_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "上色没那么均匀，但也能做到玻璃脆皮。外皮更硬，里面的汁水没那么丰富，应该是低温烤，带走了更多的水分。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107823273-19.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/7900e6c50153477a89d9ba3b09777582_1179w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "107836402",
