   "image": {
    "local": "images/2026-11-28/107253979.jpg",
    "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/8e4e6c2968754646813def4666f8c0ef_1280w_1534h.jpg"
   },
   "category": "凉菜小吃",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "里脊肉去筋膜切长条1厘米左右",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/4881bd13791e40ea8713a43b7455e841_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "所有佐料放里面喜欢辣的放点辣椒粉抓拌均匀",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/91b0e65fd97044e88292b77cda4afb71_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "放冰箱腌制12小时 中间翻拌一下",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/6f6df5046c434dd5a9490df59db12a49_1280w_1037h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "拿出已经腌制好的肉条，挂晾在烤网上晾晒4_5小时，风干下水分，直接烤也可以。我就是直接烤的",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/407abe4949514e9ca739d0e034c612cd_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "烤盘放吸油纸把肉条均匀的摆放在烤盘里放入烤盘230度烤20分钟",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/616c44bf9dcd4858b21029c8ea0a9889_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "20分钟后烤盘里都是水拿出来把水倒掉",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/366bf4413e6a423d8ecb88629234670c_1280w_903h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "把肉条翻面放入烤箱继续考20分钟注意观察有水出来的话再次倒掉继续烤只要有水就倒出来然后把肉条一根一根分离开",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c719c8aa473e454f9ab8cc4e56bead8e_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "拿出来翻面继续烤15分钟翻面",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-8.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/51b773001d64460fab95913fabce34d5_1280w_1848h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "15分钟后肉干已经初型有样子了翻面烤箱调200度继续烘烤20分钟",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-9.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1e5e39fd09dc49d6a3da0053897d92fc_1280w_1618h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "根据自己喜欢的口味不喜欢太干口感的这样就可以了喜欢干一点的可以翻面继续烤几分钟烤到自己喜欢的干的程度这时候一定在烤箱边观查翻面不要烤糊哦😂",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-10.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c0b0e4debabc45d6ada612327cffd5de_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "完美",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-11.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/15fcbda65782435f9f2d0c39b413e7ea_1280w_1534h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "可以拉丝撕着吃赶紧做起来吧做好了别忘了拍照📸交作业哦",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107253979-12.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1baffb92a21447f3a4116fc8ca7c1787_1280w_1706h.jpg"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "103907020",
   "name": "海盐奶盖珍珠奶茶",
   "url": "https://www.xiachufang.com/recipe/103907020/",
   "author": "索西与马戏团",
   "score": 9.1,
   "made": 11,
   "desc": "夏天的快乐是珍珠奶茶给的，更大的快乐是升级版【海岩奶盖珍珠奶茶】带来的，而你，是我手里的珍珠奶茶❤",
   "ingredients": [
    {
     "name": "锡兰红茶粉",
     "amount": "10g"
    },
    {
     "name": "水",
     "amount": "100ml"
    },
    {
     "name": "牛奶",
     "amount": "250ml"
    },
    {
     "name": "红糖",
     "amount": "5g"
    },
    {
     "name": "珍珠",
     "amount": "适量"
    },
    {
     "name": "煮珍珠的水",
     "amount": "水没过珍珠"
    },
    {
     "name": "淡奶油",
     "amount": "100ml"
    },
    {
     "name": "牛奶",
     "amount": "25ml"
    },
    {
     "name": "糖",
     "amount": "3g"
    },
    {
     "name": "海盐",
     "amount": "1g"
    }
   ],
   "stepCount": 5,
   "lists": [
    "rising"
   ],
   "rank": {
    "rising": 5
   },
   "image": {
    "local": "images/2026-11-28/103907020.jpg",
    "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/a0f888e6ab1841ac86ddb6e56e73e7b2_1440w_961h.jpg"
   },
   "category": "饮品",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "先煮珍珠热水煮开，调中火，倒入珍珠搅拌煮15～20分钟至无硬芯，关火，盖盖子焖15分钟，颗颗晶莹饱满的珍珠就煮好啦",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/103907020-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/95cf2cf102304037a7c3971eaf77a609_912w_518h.png"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "红茶加100ml的水、5g红糖煮出茶香，倒入滤杯，轻轻按压出茶叶，萃取茶汁。在红茶汁中倒入250ml牛奶。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/103907020-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/19d6f8ea75fa47f1bb0cf5477eb32509_894w_512h.png"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "海盐奶盖杯中倒入淡奶油100ml，牛奶25ml，糖3g，盐1g，打蛋器搅打至6成发，打到勉强流动状即可",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/103907020-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e9fb384eccdd450a85490f3d440c7df5_907w_512h.png"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "杯中放入煮好的珍珠，倒入8分满的奶茶",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/103907020-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/833041fb733d4a35b422767e9dfae0a1_904w_515h.png"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "用勺子将奶盖轻轻舀入奶茶表层一层层的叠加，不要着急。将将～海岩奶盖珍珠奶茶完成！",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/103907020-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/de4ee2d1020e4b48ba44aed0722b82bc_915w_507h.png"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
