     "text": "加入一勺生抽、一勺料酒、半勺老抽、一勺玉米淀粉",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-28/steps/107825511-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1ddc7e55d9ab4e1d8faa39860de458a6_1280w_960h.jpg"
